import{_ as e,o as i,c as n,a2 as t}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 457 | Dragon Ball · Myriad-Ranks Republican Plan: Breaking Human/Saiyan-Centrism","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 457 | Dragon Ball · Myriad-Ranks Republican Plan: Breaking Human/Saiyan-Centrism","no":457,"module":2,"tags":["Myriad-Realms Benchmark","Dragon Ball","Myriad-Ranks Republicanism","Saiyan-Centrism","Racial Equality","Five Myriad-Ranks Genealogies"],"related":["05-Myriad-Ranks Co-Progression Program","50-Myriad-Ranks Genealogy Overview","52-Alien Classification and Symbiosis"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0457_模块2-龙珠-万族共和方案-打破人族赛亚人本位.md","filePath":"en/0457_模块2-龙珠-万族共和方案-打破人族赛亚人本位.md"}'),r={name:"en/0457_模块2-龙珠-万族共和方案-打破人族赛亚人本位.md"};function o(s,a,l,d,c,u){return i(),n("div",null,[...a[0]||(a[0]=[t('<h1 id="entry-457-dragon-ball-·-myriad-ranks-republican-plan-breaking-human-saiyan-centrism" tabindex="-1">Entry 457 | Dragon Ball · Myriad-Ranks Republican Plan: Breaking Human/Saiyan-Centrism <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-457-dragon-ball-·-myriad-ranks-republican-plan-breaking-human-saiyan-centrism" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 457 | Dragon Ball · Myriad-Ranks Republican Plan: Breaking Human/Saiyan-Centrism&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Dragon Ball Full Decomposition (Entry 26 · Alternative 6) | Benchmark base: Documents 05, 50, 52</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-when-the-strongest-race-becomes-original-sin" tabindex="-1">Introduction: when the &quot;strongest race&quot; becomes original sin <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-when-the-strongest-race-becomes-original-sin" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: when the &quot;strongest race&quot; becomes original sin&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Dragon Ball world&#39;s racial order is: Saiyans (strongest combat race) &gt; Earthlings/Namekians (ordinary intelligent races) &gt; Frieza-army subordinate races (conquered) &gt; others (backdrop). The Saiyan race itself was Frieza&#39;s army&#39;s conquest tool; though Goku lost his memory, he inherited this racial original sin. This entry takes the republican axiom of Myriad Races as core, giving the republican plan to &quot;break human/Saiyan-centrism.&quot;</p><p>This entry&#39;s judging base is the six top-level axioms and five mandatory cores, with the law-first axiom as core. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Saiyan-centrism&#39;s energy waste:</p><ul><li><strong>Saiyan talent monopolized</strong>: near-death-revival gain, Super Saiyan transformation route, all only serve Saiyans</li><li><strong>Myriad-Ranks talent undeveloped</strong>: Namekians&#39; Dragon-Ball creation ability, Yardrats&#39; Instant Transmission technology, Frieza-army subordinate races&#39; various talents, all narratively marginalized</li><li><strong>Racial stratification</strong>: Frieza-army subordinate races defined as &quot;conquered&quot;; their civilizational value zeroed</li></ul><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression&quot;">​</a></h2><p>How Saiyan-centrism feeds historical regression:</p><ol><li><strong>Myriad Ranks have no upward channel</strong>: Saiyans can transform by bloodline alone; Myriad Ranks however hardworking cannot catch up — civilization tilts toward the Saiyan race</li><li><strong>Conquered have no voice</strong>: Frieza-army subordinate races in narrative are only backdrop; their suffering unrecorded</li><li><strong>Racial conflict loop</strong>: Saiyans were once Frieza&#39;s tool; though Goku defected, the Saiyan race&#39;s predatory history was never purged</li></ol><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Goku&#39;s predatory thinking under Saiyan-centrism:</p><ul><li><strong>Accepting bloodline superiority</strong>: Goku never questions &quot;why Saiyans are born able to transform into Super Saiyan&quot;; he defaults it as natural</li><li><strong>Myriad-Ranks suffering forgotten</strong>: Planet Vegeta destroyed by Frieza, but Goku never leads Namekians, Yardrats and other races invaded by Saiyans to seek justice</li><li><strong>Saiyan = hero narrative</strong>: the whole Dragon Ball world&#39;s hero narrative revolves around Saiyans; Myriad Ranks have no position in narrative</li></ul><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Dragon Ball Saiyan-Centrism</th><th>Anchor Republican Alternative</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Saiyan talent monopolized</td><td>Five Myriad-Ranks genealogies equal: carbon-based material / energy-coagulated / mechanical-constructed / consciousness-information / mixed-mutant</td></tr><tr><td>Myriad-Ranks talent undeveloped</td><td>300 Origin cultivation systems, six categories × 50 each; Myriad-Ranks groups have differentiated cultivation paths</td></tr><tr><td>Frieza subordinate races = backdrop</td><td>Doc 52 Alien Classification and Symbiosis: any race included in Myriad-Ranks republicanism</td></tr><tr><td>Saiyan predatory history unpurged</td><td>Anti-predation axiom: Saiyan predatory history enshrined for reflection; not as hero narrative</td></tr><tr><td>Racial conflict loop</td><td>Anchor Council legislation: racial equality enshrined; any racial discrimination unconstitutional</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Modeling</strong>: Quest Sediment Domain replicates Dragon Ball world; break Saiyan-centrism</li><li><strong>Variables</strong>: inject &quot;Namekians&#39; Dragon-Ball creation ability public,&quot; &quot;Yardrats&#39; Instant Transmission textbook-ified,&quot; &quot;Frieza subordinate races included in republicanism&quot;</li><li><strong>Observation</strong>: count Myriad-Ranks cultivator exit rate, racial conflict times, civilization long-term construction rate</li><li><strong>Review</strong>: output <em>Breaking Saiyan-Centrism Benefit Report</em>, quantifying Myriad-Ranks republicanism&#39;s civilizational uplift to Dragon Ball world</li></ol><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Saiyan-centrism self-consistency: low</strong> (Super Saiyan from millennium legend devalued to bloodline standard)</li><li><strong>Myriad-Ranks republican self-consistency expected: high</strong> (five genealogies equal; cultivation paths diverse)</li><li><strong>Retcon-ending risk</strong>: from extremely high to medium (after racial diversification, no need to continue by &quot;adding a stronger race&quot;)</li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency</strong>: from high to medium-low (Saiyans no longer sole hero race)</li></ul><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: Namekians&#39;, Yardrats&#39; talents all developed</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: Saiyan predatory history enshrined for reflection; racial discrimination unconstitutional</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo at least broke internal human aristocratic monopoly; Dragon Ball needs to break racial monopoly</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: five Myriad-Ranks genealogies all included in republicanism; Saiyans no longer centric</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: racial diversification lets Dragon Ball world truly expand into a multiverse federation</li><li><strong>Universal equal infinite law</strong>: basic infinite power inherent in all; easygoing retain guarantee, strivers can superimpose higher; infinite origin eliminates predation motive</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Breaking Saiyan-centrism is not to belittle Goku, but to let Myriad Ranks no longer live in the shadow of &quot;Saiyans are born stronger.&quot; Namekians can make Dragon Balls, Yardrats can Instant Transmission, Frieza subordinate races have various talents — these talents should not be covered by Saiyans&#39; light. Let Myriad Ranks each show their strengths, each cultivate their own Dao; Dragon Ball world then truly deserves the word &quot;cosmos.&quot;</p><p>In the final analysis, Dragon Ball · Myriad-Ranks republican plan · breaking human/Saiyan-centrism described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./456_模块2-龙珠-阿赖耶监管方案-杜绝战力膨胀的制度设计.html">Entry 456 · Alaya Supervision</a> · <a href="./458_模块2-龙珠-法则优先对照-衡元宙如何避免战力膨胀.html">Entry 458 · Law-First Comparison</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/05-万族共进基本纲领.html">05-Myriad-Ranks Co-Progression Program</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',28)])])}const m=e(r,[["render",o]]);export{g as __pageData,m as default};
